        "verdict": "supported",
        "answer": "Samah is an AI Team Lead and AI/ML Engineer who specializes in building AI-powered applications, backend APIs, intelligent automation workflows, dashboards, chatbots, and document-processing solutions. She also develops modern web platforms and full-stack applications.\n\nKey points:\n- She is strongest in backend development and AI-focused work.\n- Samah enjoys creating practical business solutions that have a clear impact.\n- Her expertise includes automating manual workflows and transforming unstructured data into useful structured outputs.\n- She utilizes technologies like Django, Python, Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS for her projects.\n- She has experience with various AI and LLM technologies, including Hugging Face Transformers, Gemini, LangChain, and RAG workflows.\n- Specific projects she has built include a live smart electricity dashboard, an auditing employee payroll system, and an AI property search chatbot.",
